1. Scanner user-agent rules — plugin/assets/data/
------------------------------------------------------------------

Files:
  assets/data/gr-ua-crawlers.txt    (crawler patterns, matched
                                     case-insensitively)
  assets/data/gr-ua-exclusions.txt  (browser-token patterns stripped
                                     from the agent before matching)

Source:   JayBizzle/Crawler-Detect
          https://github.com/JayBizzle/Crawler-Detect

License:  MIT — Copyright (c) 2015-2020 Mark Beech (m@rkbee.ch)

The pattern lists were extracted from the source's fixture arrays
and re-hosted here as plain data under greenpng's own maintenance;
each data file carries the copyright header inline. Behavior parity
against the reference library was verified at extraction time
(18/18 sample user agents identical verdicts).

Data date: 2026-09-10 (1468 crawler patterns, 52 exclusion
patterns). Later edits to these files are greenpng maintenance and
are recorded in the repository changelog, not here.

